{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54546","headline":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"猛将气，龙虎两（京本作「气」）两连。\n挂翳蔽天兼掠地，蔓瓜盖路（京本作「地」）覆平川，坚守莫争先。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}